    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its height, form and appearance, would result in an overdevelopment of the site to the visual detriment of the character and appearance of the area. the proposal would result in less than substantial harm to the character and appearance of the Lambton Road Conservation Area and the public benefits of the proposal are not considered to outweigh this harm. There would be inadequate standards of external amenity space and a harmful impact on the living conditions of neighbouring occupiers by way of noise disturbance, overlooking and loss of outlook, contrary to Policies HC1, D3, D4 and D6 of the London Plan 2021, Policy CS14 of the Core Planning Strategy 2011 and Policies DM D2, DM D3 and DM D4 of the Sites and Policies Plan 2014."
